  "valueInterpretation": [
    "RGB numbers are copied verbatim from serialized materials. Native PlayerSettings m_ActiveColorSpace=0 (Gamma), so native color arithmetic uses sRGB-number space. Respect Godot OUTPUT_IS_SRGB: Compatibility already uses this domain; convert only in a linear working renderer.",
    "Single-color shaders have padded 5-element arrays for consumption; *NativeCount states how many original color properties exist.",
    "Missing common-shader _Specular is represented by specularSoft=false with specularSoftNativePropertyPresent=false. This does not imply no specular.",
    "_Specular is labelled Soft Specular / Toggle(SPECULAR) in original AvatarGS shader; false does not establish that all highlights are disabled.",
    "Face has no original second-shadow or light-area property; secondShadowColor is a same-color fallback marked secondShadowColorNative=false.",
    "Original outline width and _Scale are not screen-space pixel units. Do not assign outlineWidth directly to the current outline_pixels shader."
  ],
